-------------------------------

Usage rules:

Font Awesome icons are available for terminal UI enhancement.

The agent MAY use these icons when they improve readability, organization, or visual clarity. Icon usage is optional and decided by the agent.

Use icons naturally:
- Use file icons when showing file lists, project trees, or created files.
- Use model/AI icons when displaying AI models, agents, or AI-related components.
- Use tool icons when showing available tools or actions.
- Use status icons for important states such as success, warning, error, running, or waiting.

Do not force icons into normal conversation.
Do not add icons to every sentence.
Do not replace clear text with icons.

If the user asks for the available icons, symbols, or UI icons, provide the icon catalog with the symbol, code, and meaning.